  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/1623",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요^^<br>별과 우주 하려고 버니어 조도센서를 사서<br>야심차게 예비실험을 했는데 아래와 같이 나왔습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8490c4bec019025f3cd7085abf995f3f09b42073\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8490c4bec019025f3cd7085abf995f3f09b42073\" data-origin-width=\"2640\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">감소하는건 확실한데 거리가 2배, 3배, 4배될때<br>밝기가 1/4, 1/9, 1/16이 되지 않았습니다. <br>몇번을 반복하고 알아낸게 주변 빛의 노이즈였습니다.ㅜㅜ<br>생각해보면 너무 당연한건데...ㅜㅜ<br>그래서 각 거리에서 핸드폰 플래시를 껐을때(A), 켰을때(B) 값을 각각 측정해서 (B-A)를 하니까 얼쭈 비슷했습니다.<br>그런데 조도센서가 1개뿐이라 아이들이 다하게 하려면? 이란 고민을 하게 됐고, 앱을 찾았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d08fb58c48ef3100135870437b752c0166baa9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1d08fb58c48ef3100135870437b752c0166baa9e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"422\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이 앱을 이용해서 모둠별로 핸드폰 2개를 이용해<br>하나는 빛의 세기를 측정하고 하나는 플래시를 켜는 용도로 실험하게 했습니다.<br>값의 차이는 크지만 아이들에게 실험하고 값을 기록하고<br>그 값을 이해하게 하는데는 도움이 될 것 같아서 공유드립니다.ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/694ddff76204e090446c23c6d794095c3bd4a56f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/694ddff76204e090446c23c6d794095c3bd4a56f\" data-origin-width=\"1876\" data-origin-height=\"1042\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81ce690544e91c0a8b029670942a920695d2e68d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81ce690544e91c0a8b029670942a920695d2e68d\" data-origin-width=\"967\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래는 학생들에게 실험 방법을 안내하려고 만든 영상입니다.<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/LvWlFd1AYw8?si=ps1kqOd-MJLrnzUp\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/LvWlFd1AYw8?si=ps1kqOd-MJLrnzUp</a><br> <br>간편하게 해보실분 참고하세요^^<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05515f4441eb910feb857cdf9febfb2dacb45080\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05515f4441eb910feb857cdf9febfb2dacb45080\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d4b3762d7e3cef5e6d14715eba3ac2df5fc50a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d4b3762d7e3cef5e6d14715eba3ac2df5fc50a3\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0ecba04cc13ad2fc53a1a5e3e1bbd531af57abd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b0ecba04cc13ad2fc53a1a5e3e1bbd531af57abd\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ae73db0c305b2190d8cc51b7474e0cfcb327039\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ae73db0c305b2190d8cc51b7474e0cfcb327039\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
